<title>ESTONIA: Estonian prices rise 0.6 percent in Oct.</title>
<headline>Estonian prices rise 0.6 percent in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian consumer prices rose by 0.6 percent in October, the same rate as in September, for a year-on-year rate increase of 17.2 percent, the country's statistics department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>					 Oct 96    Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (PCT)     +0.6	  +0.6	+3.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (PCT)	+17.2	 +20.1     +28.4</p>
<p> Index (1993 average =100)	239.4	 237.9     204.3</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
